---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
import { GITHUB_URL } from '../consts';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="Who's behind codingdan, and what this place is for."
	pubDate={new Date('2026-01-01')}
>
	<p class="lead">
		Hi — I'm Dan. <strong>codingdan</strong> is my corner of the internet for working things out in public:
		the bugs that stole a weekend, the architecture decisions I'd make differently now, and the small
		tools that quietly made my life better.
	</p>

	<h2>What you'll find here</h2>
	<p>
		Mostly long-form notes on building and running software — backend systems, infrastructure, the
		odd front-end experiment, and whatever rabbit hole has my attention this month. I write the post
		I wish I'd found when I was stuck.
	</p>

	<h2>Why a blog</h2>
	<p>
		Writing forces me to actually understand a thing rather than just get it working. If a post saves
		you an afternoon of head-scratching, that's the whole point.
	</p>

	<blockquote>Weeks of coding can save you hours of planning.</blockquote>

	<h2>Say hello</h2>
	<p>
		Code and projects live on <a href={GITHUB_URL} target="_blank" rel="me noopener">GitHub</a>. You
		can also subscribe via <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a> to catch new posts.
	</p>
</Layout>
